# What this file does
#   Makes git store text files with LF line endings and treat images, PDFs and Word files as binary.
# Why it exists
#   Windows checkouts would otherwise turn line endings into CRLF, which breaks the shell git hooks and marks
#   whole files as changed; binary files must never have their bytes converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
